{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_ILLUMOS__"}}----

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}
	""__FB_ILLUMOS__""

{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Define without a value created at compile time when the illumos target is
	being used.  The ##sunos## target spelling also selects the illumos target.

	When compiling for illumos, the compiler also defines ##[[KeyPgDdfbsolaris|__FB_SOLARIS__]]## for Solaris-family compatibility.

{{fbdoc item="ex"}}
%%(freebasic)
#IFDEF __FB_ILLUMOS__
	print "illumos target"
#ENDIF
%%

{{fbdoc item="back" value="CatPgDddefines|Predefined Defines"}}
{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	[[KeyPgDdfbsolaris|__FB_SOLARIS__]]
	[[CompilerOpttarget|Compiler Option: -target]]
----
